        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although industry figures are not available, based on our analysis of this market, we believe that we are the market share leader for both the motorcycle and boat products and that we are one of the largest providers of RV insurance.",
        "start_character": 4417,
        "end_character": 4650
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000080661-26-000086",
