        "accession_number": "0000080661-26-000086",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As with our personal auto products, we regularly introduce new commercial auto product models designed to improve our pricing accuracy and competitiveness through improved segmentation, the use of additional risk variables, and other enhancements.",
        "start_character": 18131,
        "end_character": 18378
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000080661-26-000086",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000080661-26-000086-459ccfa7415e8b8c",
        "accession_number": "0000080661-26-000086",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the highly competitive nature of the property-casualty insurance markets in which we operate, many competitors invest heavily in advertising and marketing efforts and/or expanding their online or mobile service offerings.",
        "start_character": 31568,
        "end_character": 31796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000080661-26-000086",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000080661-26-000086-459ccfa7415e8b8c",
        "accession_number": "0000080661-26-000086",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our Personal Lines property business, we manage claims through a network of independent claim field adjusters and employee claim representatives who manage the overall claims process.",
        "start_character": 30561,
        "end_character": 30748
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000080661-26-000086",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000080661-26-000086-459ccfa7415e8b8c",
        "accession_number": "0000080661-26-000086",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, our competitive position could be adversely impacted if we, or one of our third-party vendors, experience a cybersecurity attack or incident or we are unable to maintain uninterrupted access to our systems, business functions, and the systems of certain third-party providers.",
        "start_character": 32530,
        "end_character": 32819
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000080661-26-000086",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000080661-26-000086-459ccfa7415e8b8c",
        "accession_number": "0000080661-26-000086",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We appreciate that engaged employees are more productive, provide better service to our customers, and are more likely to stay with Progressive.",
        "start_character": 51160,
        "end_character": 51304
      },
      {
